  "contract": {
    "owner": "Each existing provider owns one selected capture device/activation. Private exact issued handles only; no second chooser or public raw native owner. Input-only profiles preserve their previous contract.",
    "hid": "Optional closed reviewed output:{reportId:0..255,format:boolean-byte/1}, actual exactly matching absolute8-bit output layout and current sendReport. Report ID is the native argument; exactly one owned false0/true1 byte. No feature report, fallback or arbitrary raw bytes.",
    "serial": "Optional reviewed writeFormat:boolean-byte/1. Same private opened port and genuine intrinsic WritableStream/getWriter/write/releaseLock. Real continuous read remains independent; no extra port, arbitrary raw protocol, writer.close or automatic reset.",
    "authority": "Default-deny separate exact output request/signal/expiry no later than capture. Independently approved reliable application event subscribe to command invoke; exact same owned Connection plus actual running OperationRecord supplies numeric deadline/age/rate. All callbacks precede final fresh clock and intrinsic/private state issuance fence.",
    "limits": "Each one output sink/write/byte,32 attempts,2Hz,max age100ms,16 records. Caller four registrations,two routes,two pending and31 command IDs. Existing capture quotas/timers retained. HID combined9 listeners; Serial combined8. Native/read/write cleanup reservations remain actual until their issued work settles.",
    "retirement": "Stop/revoke/expiry retires authority without reset. HID owned close waits actual sendReport; Serial reader cancel/read and actual write settle, both locks release before owned close. Late genuine sink unregister false/throw quarantines. Unreturned/unknown issued work is held uncertain, never treated as native cancellation.",
    "observation": "API-returned/rejected/uncertain is separate from independent input-report/read state. Cancelled issued commands remain uncertain after later API return; no physical acknowledgement or device observation fabricated.",
    "callerRecovery": "Actual direct clock exceptions after binding or before publication now call owned Stop and return unavailable. All three actual public callers witnessed OLD throws after genuine capture/output binding with nativeWrites0; corrected tests verify no residual authority, actual cleanup settlement and fresh route/write recovery. Denied route setup retains explicit Stop/reselect recovery; in-place denied-route retry is not claimed.",
    "publicExamples": [
      "@101/connect/examples/hid-switch-output",
      "@101/connect/examples/serial-switch-output"
    ],
    "wholeScope": "A02/A03/A04/N02 stay OPEN. Physical hardware/native chooser/permissions/unplug/reconnect/latency, other vendor/HID/USB protocols, Modbus/CRC/register/scaling/bounded retries/TCP and broad resource matrix remain deferred."
